             "copies/kt852zf4103#inscription"
            ],
            "note": "Graded medium on the figures of the date: one figure is arguable. Pencil, six figures run together with no separators: 3, 1, 1, 0 (a narrow slanted loop), 2, 2. Read as 31.10.22. The grouping is the only doubt; the figures themselves are legible."
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       },
       "medium": "pencil"
      }
     ]
